---
import { CONTATO_LZBA } from '../data/empreendimentos';
---

<footer class="bg-lzba-dark border-t border-lzba-border/20 text-lzba-muted">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      
      <!-- Coluna 1: Logo & Divisor -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block" aria-label="LZBA Início">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo.png" 
            alt="LZBA Construtora e Incorporadora" 
            class="h-10 sm:h-12 w-auto object-contain" 
            width="170" 
            height="44"
          />
        </a>
        <div class="w-full max-w-xs h-px bg-lzba-border/30"></div>
        <p class="text-xs text-lzba-muted leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Solidez técnica, tradição e consistência executiva para valorizar o patrimônio da sua família.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 2: Menu -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-heading">
          Menu
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span class="text-lzba-muted group-hover:text-lzba-gold">»</span> INÍCIO
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sobre" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span class="text-lzba-muted group-hover:text-lzba-gold">»</span> SOBRE
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/empreendimentos" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span class="text-lzba-muted group-hover:text-lzba-gold">»</span> NOSSOS PROJETOS
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/trabalhe-conosco" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span class="text-lzba-muted group-hover:text-lzba-gold">»</span> OPORTUNIDADES
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/contato" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span class="text-lzba-muted group-hover:text-lzba-gold">»</span> CONTATOS
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 3: Contatos -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-heading">
          Contatos
        </h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-lzba-muted block font-medium">Telefone</span>
            <a href={`tel:${CONTATO_LZBA.telefone.replace(/\D/g, '')}`} class="text-white hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors font-medium">
              11 2691 9059
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-lzba-muted block font-medium">Email</span>
            <a href={`mailto:${CONTATO_LZBA.email}`} class="text-white hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors font-medium break-all">
              {CONTATO_LZBA.email}
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-lzba-muted block font-medium">Endereço</span>
            <p class="text-white font-medium leading-relaxed">
              {CONTATO_LZBA.endereco}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Barra Inferior de Direitos e Política -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-lzba-border/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-lzba-muted">
      <p class="text-center sm:text-left">
        © LZBA Construtora • Todos os direitos reservados. Desenvolvido com ♥ por <span class="text-neutral-300">3dJobs</span>
      </p>
      <div>
        <a href="/politica-de-privacidade" class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors">
          Política de Privacidade
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
